    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d295">

                <pb facs="0417" n="335" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/3788: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Salvador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-07-06T09:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6, 1925—9
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 5:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>38. Legation’s 23, May 29th.<anchor n="31" xml:id="d295-f1"/> Ferrera arrived
                    here yesterday from Guatemala and the Minister for Foreign Affairs assures me
                    that he will be kept under strict surveillance.</p>
                <p>Repeated Tegucigalpa and Guatemala.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
